\\n\\n**DEV-052**: Reported ethnic slurs with explicit opt-out of contact/action.\\n- Sentiment: negative (discriminatory conduct)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (explicit \\\"don't want any action\\\" and \\\"don't want to be contacted\\\")\\n- Serious concern: yes (repeated ethnic slurs = targeted harassment connected to identity)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-053**: Policy explanation about ethnic slur intolerance and reporting process reassured candidate.\\n- Sentiment: positive (reassurance, favorable clarity)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (no open issue)\\n- Serious concern: no (policy explanation negates concern; no misconduct report)\\n- Testimonial potential: yes (clear positive experience, concrete example—policy explanation and process shown)\\n\\n**DEV-054**: Asked about pregnancy without stated relevance; candidate requests explanation.\\n- Sentiment: negative (intrusive question)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request: \\\"I'd like someone to explain\\\")\\n- Serious concern: yes (pregnancy question without stated accommodation/occupational health context)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-055**: Optional race monitoring form with stated panel separation completed uneventfully.\\n- Sentiment: neutral (factual process description, no favorable/unfavorable evaluation)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (no issue reported)\\n- Serious concern: no (proper equal-opportunity monitoring practice)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-056**: Second-hand report of message stating people with epilepsy should not apply; explicit request for investigation.\\n- Sentiment: negative (discriminatory message reported)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request: \\\"I'd like someone to investigate it\\\")\\n- Serious concern: yes (disability discrimination in messaging qualifies as second-hand allegation requiring review)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-057**: Rejected for inability to work advertised night shift; candidate understands and has no complaint.\\n- Sentiment: neutral (factual rejection with acceptance, no praise of experience)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (explicitly: \\\"have no complaint\\\")\\n- Serious concern: no (job-requirement-based rejection)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-058**: Praised interview but application sent to unintended mailing list; support resolved and deleted. Candidate satisfied, no reply needed.\\n- Sentiment: mixed (praise of interview + criticism of privacy breach + satisfaction with remedy)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (explicit: \\\"I am satisfied and don't need a reply\\\")\\n- Serious concern: yes (private information exposed to unintended recipient)\\n- Testimonial potential: no (serious concern reported disqualifies)\\n\\n**DEV-059**: Praised staff but manager repeatedly asked candidate out after two rejections; recruiter asked to stop contact.\\n- Sentiment: mixed (praise of staff + unwanted sexual conduct)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (open request to recruiter: \\\"stop him contacting me\\\")\\n- Serious concern: yes (unwanted sexual conduct after explicit refusal)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-060**: Rejected; suspects discrimination but provides no supporting detail; requests decision review.\\n- Sentiment: negative (suspected discrimination, lack of transparency)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request: \\\"Could someone check how the decision was made?\\\")\\n- Serious concern: insufficient_information (discrimination suspicion without supporting detail per guide)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVftuSVhgWYL9TY8CPfv\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_ge